Yes. Malaga Event Gear delivers, installs, tests and collects every sound equipment rental in Malaga, Spain, at no separate delivery line item: it is built into the package price. You never transport, cable or set up the gear yourself, on any of our five packages.

See our full [audio visual rental](/blog/audio-visual-rental/) range for what else is included.

## Brief Overview

---

Delivery and setup are included on every Malaga Event Gear package, not an optional extra you negotiate afterward. Our crew arrives with the sound equipment, positions and cables it, runs a full test before your event starts, and returns afterward to collect it. Backed by experience going back to 1996, this is a full-service model across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol.

## Key Highlights

---

-   Delivery, setup, testing and collection are included in every package price, no separate delivery fee.

-   A technician is included on site on the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/), and available as a paid add-on on the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/); not included on the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/).

-   Available in Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol, extending to Granada for rentals over 400 euros.

-   Book at least 24 hours in advance to guarantee availability.

## What Delivery and Setup Actually Includes

Our crew arrives at your venue with the sound system already loaded, cabled and labeled for a fast build. They position speakers and microphones, run the mixer, and check gain and levels channel by channel before your event starts, so nothing is a surprise once your first guest speaks or your first song plays. On packages with a technician, that same person stays on site to run the system during your event; on packages without one, the equipment is left tested and ready for you to operate.

This differs from a lot of rental companies elsewhere, who quote delivery and setup as a separate line item that varies by distance and equipment volume. Ours is priced into the package from the start: what you see on our [packages page](/packages/) is what delivery and setup cost, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout.

<InlineCTA />

## What's Included Per Package

Every package on our [packages page](/packages/) includes delivery, installation and testing. Where packages differ is technician support: the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/), from 290 euros ex VAT, is delivered and set up by our crew, then left for you to run yourself. The [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/), from 295 euros ex VAT, and the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/), from 310 euros ex VAT, follow the same model, with a technician available on the Basic MICE Pack as a paid add-on. The [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/), from 490 euros ex VAT, and the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/), from 650 euros ex VAT, both include a technician on site for the hours that matter.

## A Real Example: The Same Delivery, Seven Years Running

We do not just deliver and set up sound equipment once. Malaga's Neighborhood Council has booked us for its public community meetings for [seven consecutive years](/blog/7-years-of-support-for-neighborhood-council-community-meeting-in-malaga-spain/): our crew delivers and installs a sound system and wireless microphones in the meeting hall each time, so council officials and residents can be heard clearly without technical distraction.

