## FAQs

### Do you deliver and set up the sound equipment yourselves, or do I collect it?

We deliver and set up. Our crew brings the equipment to your venue, installs and tests it, and returns afterward to collect it. You never transport or set it up yourself.

### Is there an extra fee for delivery and setup?

No. Delivery, installation, testing and collection are included in the price shown on our [packages page](/packages/), not billed as a separate line item.

### Do you provide a technician to run the sound during my event?

It depends on the package. A technician is included on the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/), available as a paid add-on on the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/), and not included on the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/).

### How far in advance do I need to book delivery?

At least 24 hours ahead to guarantee availability. For a larger event, book as soon as your date and venue are confirmed.

### Do you deliver sound equipment outside Malaga city?

Yes, across the wider Costa del Sol, extending to Granada for rentals over 400 euros.

### What happens after my event, do I need to pack up the equipment myself?

No. Our crew returns to your venue after the event to collect and remove everything.

### Can you deliver and set up sound equipment for an outdoor event?

Yes. See our [how to set up rented audio visual equipment for outdoor events](/blog/how-to-set-up-rented-audio-visual-equipment-for-outdoor-events/) guide for what changes outdoors, or our [audio visual rental for outdoor events](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-outdoor-events/) guide for venue-specific setups.
